<% layout("layouts/boilerplate") -%>

    <div class="row mx-3">
        <h1 class="text-center mb-4">Join Us</h1>
        <form action="/join_us" method="POST" class="needs-validation" novalidate>
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6 offset-md-3">
                <div class="mb-4 form-floating">
                    <select class="form-select" name="helper_type" id="helper_type">
                        <option value="seller">Becoming a seller</option>
                        <option value="delivery">Helping us with delivery</option>
                    </select>
                    <label for="helper_type" class="form-label">In which way can you help us?</label>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-4 mb-4 d-flex justify-content-center">
                    <button class="btn btn-primary">Yes, I will help.</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </form>
    </div>
    <div class="container my-4">
        <h3>Why You Should Consider Selling Your Books Through Our Platform?</h3>
        <p>
            Ready to declutter your bookshelf and earn some extra cash? Sell your books through us and enjoy a
            hassle-free experience that saves you time and money.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you are looking to sell your used textbooks and help out your fellow college students? You've come to the
            right place! Our platform makes it easy to connect with buyers and get the most value out of your books.
        </p>
        <p>
            We know you're busy, and selling your old books can be a pain. But with our user-friendly website and
            dedicated support team, you can make the process simple and stress-free.
            Plus, you'll be doing your part to
            promote <span class="text-success">sustainability</span> and reduce waste on campus!
    </div>
    <div class="container mb-4">
        <h3>Why You Should Consider Helping Us With Delivery?</h3>
        <p>
            <b>Gain Work Experience:</b> You will gain valuable work experience that will help you
            build your resumes and prepare for your future careers. Becoming a book courier for your website could be
            a great way for you to gain experience in logistics, customer service, and time management.
        </p>
        <p>

            <b>Flexible Schedule:</b> Our book courier position is flexible and can fit around your class schedule.
        </p>
        <p>
            <b>Network Building:</b> By becoming a book courier you will get the opportunity to
            network with other students and potentially build connections for future career opportunities.
        </p>
        <p>
            <b>Community Involvement:</b> Becoming book courier will involved you in local community by helping other
            college
            students save money on textbooks. This can be a rewarding experience for
            students who are looking to make a positive impact.
        </p>
        <p>
            <b>Perks and Rewards:</b> Although we are not be able to offer monetary compensation, we can consider
            offering
            other perks and rewards to you or your team of book couriers. For example, we can offer discounts on
            textbooks
            sold
        </p>
    </div>
    <script src="/js/validation_form.js"></script>